{
  "schema": "hima-pdk-cards/3",
  "about": "How the Pack reaches each PDK's device models. Paths are relative to the Site's pdkRoot as the simulators see it. simulators lists, in order of preference, the simulators that read the PDK; decks gives each one's include files, the SPICE .lib sections per corner and OSDI models; a device's op names where each simulator writes its operating point. IHP SG13G2's Spectre deck is the Site's conversion of IHP's own files (sites/analog_sim_01/install/ihp_spectre.py). A card states facts of the PDK, never a design choice.",
